    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 0.7
  m_Text: "The room is set, apprentice.\nEverything you've learned has led to this
    moment.\n\nNow is the time to prove your skill\u2014\nto weave with confidence,
    precision, and power.\n\nI believe in you! The magic answers to those who trust
    in their craft.\nLet\u2019s see how swiftly you can complete this Final Trial
    of the Weave!\n\nWhen you're ready..."
